\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. All creatures of our God and King,
\par Lift up your voice and with us sing;
\par Alleluia, Alleluia!
\par Thou burning sun with golden beam,
\par Thou silver moon with softer gleam:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par O praise Him o praise Him,
\par Alleluia, Alleluia, Alleluia!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\i0\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thou rushing wind that art so strong,
\par Ye clouds that sail in heaven along,
\par O praise Him Alleleuia!
\par Thou rising mourn, in praise rejoice,
\par Ye lights of  evening, find a voice:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par O praise Him o praise Him,
\par Alleluia, Alleluia, Alleluia!
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thou flowing water, pure and clear,
\par Make music for  thy Lord to hear,
\par Alleluia, Alleluia!
\par Thou fire so masterful and bright,
\par That givest man both warmth and light:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par O praise Him o praise Him,
\par Alleluia, Alleluia, Alleluia!
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Dear mother earth, who day by day,
\par Unfoldest blessings on our way,
\par O praise Him, Alleluia!
\par The flowers and fruits that in thee grow,
\par Let them His glory also show:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par O praise Him o praise Him,
\par Alleluia, Alleluia, Alleluia!
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. And all ye men of tender heart,
\par Forgiving others, take your part,
\par O sing ye, Alleluia!
\par Ye who long pain and sorrow bear
\par Praise God and on Him cast your care:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par O praise Him o praise Him,
\par Alleluia, Alleluia, Alleluia!
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. And thou, most and gentle death,
\par Waiting to hush our latest breath,
\par O praise Him, Alleluia!
\par Thou leadest home the child of God
\par And Christ our Lord the way hath trod:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par O praise Him o praise Him,
\par Alleluia, Alleluia, Alleluia!
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. Let all things their Creator bless,
\par And worship Him in humbleness,
\par O praise Him, Alleluia!
\par Praise, praise the Father, praise the Son
\par And praise the Spirit, Three in one:
\par \pard\qc\b 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par O praise Him o praise Him,
\par Alleluia, Alleluia, Alleluia!
\par \i0\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

